  "basicText": {
    "title": "基本课文",
    "basicSentences": [
      {
        "id": "l30-basic-s001",
        "order": 1,
        "text": "もう11時だから寝よう。",
        "translationZh": "已经11点了，睡吧。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "1. もう11時だから寝よう。",
        "audioSegment": {
          "id": "l30-basic-s001",
          "trackId": "lesson_basic",
          "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson30/l30-basic-s001.mp3",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 1.9,
          "duration": 1.9,
          "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
          "confidence": "approved",
          "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:08:52.445Z",
          "sourceAudioSha256": "5f363eb31b33860f3dffc438d76a2beda75950f838bb5fca59fa6ce89d901f6d"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "l30-basic-s002",
        "order": 2,
        "text": "今日、会社を休もうと思います。",
        "translationZh": "我想今天请假不上班。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "2. 今日、会社を休もうと思います。",
        "audioSegment": {
          "id": "l30-basic-s002",
          "trackId": "lesson_basic",
          "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson30/l30-basic-s002.mp3",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2.74,
          "duration": 2.74,
          "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
          "confidence": "approved",
          "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:08:52.445Z",
          "sourceAudioSha256": "5f363eb31b33860f3dffc438d76a2beda75950f838bb5fca59fa6ce89d901f6d"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "l30-basic-s003",
        "order": 3,
        "text": "明日、病院へ行こうと思っています。",
        "translationZh": "我打算明天去医院。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "3. 明日、病院へ行こうと思っています。",
        "audioSegment": {
          "id": "l30-basic-s003",
          "trackId": "lesson_basic",
          "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson30/l30-basic-s003.mp3",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2.9,
          "duration": 2.9,
          "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
          "confidence": "approved",
          "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:08:52.445Z",
          "sourceAudioSha256": "5f363eb31b33860f3dffc438d76a2beda75950f838bb5fca59fa6ce89d901f6d"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "l30-basic-s004",
        "order": 4,
        "text": "荷物が重いので、宅配便で送ります。",
        "translationZh": "行李很重，所以用宅配便寄送。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "4. 荷物が重いので、宅配便で送ります。",
        "audioSegment": {
          "id": "l30-basic-s004",
          "trackId": "lesson_basic",
          "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson30/l30-basic-s004.mp3",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 3.3,
          "duration": 3.3,
          "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
          "confidence": "approved",
          "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:08:52.445Z",
          "sourceAudioSha256": "5f363eb31b33860f3dffc438d76a2beda75950f838bb5fca59fa6ce89d901f6d"
        }
      }
    ],
    "dialogues": [
      {
        "id": "l30-basic-dialogue-001",
        "label": "A",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l30-basic-dialogue-001-line-001",
            "speaker": "甲",
            "text": "仕事が終わってから、飲みに行こうよ。",
            "translationZh": "工作结束后去喝一杯吧。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "甲：仕事が終わってから、飲みに行こうよ。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l30-basic-dialogue-001-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_basic",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson30/l30-basic-dialogue-001-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 2.34,
              "duration": 2.34,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:08:52.445Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "5f363eb31b33860f3dffc438d76a2beda75950f838bb5fca59fa6ce89d901f6d"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l30-basic-dialogue-001-line-002",
            "speaker": "乙",
            "text": "ごめん。明日早いから、今日はちょっと…。",
            "translationZh": "抱歉。明天要早起，今天就算了吧。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "乙：ごめん。明日早いから、今日はちょっと…。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l30-basic-dialogue-001-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_basic",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson30/l30-basic-dialogue-001-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.74,
              "duration": 3.74,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:08:52.445Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "5f363eb31b33860f3dffc438d76a2beda75950f838bb5fca59fa6ce89d901f6d"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l30-basic-dialogue-002",
        "label": "B",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l30-basic-dialogue-002-line-001",
            "speaker": "甲",
            "text": "もう遅いので、そろそろ帰ろうと思います。",
            "translationZh": "已经很晚了，我想差不多该回去了。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "甲：もう遅いので、そろそろ帰ろうと思います。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l30-basic-dialogue-002-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_basic",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson30/l30-basic-dialogue-002-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.14,
              "duration": 3.14,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:08:52.445Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "5f363eb31b33860f3dffc438d76a2beda75950f838bb5fca59fa6ce89d901f6d"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l30-basic-dialogue-002-line-002",
            "speaker": "乙",
            "text": "お疲れ様でした。気をつけて。",
            "translationZh": "您辛苦了。路上小心。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "乙：お疲れ様でした。気をつけて。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l30-basic-dialogue-002-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_basic",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson30/l30-basic-dialogue-002-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 2.74,
              "duration": 2.74,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:08:52.445Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "5f363eb31b33860f3dffc438d76a2beda75950f838bb5fca59fa6ce89d901f6d"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l30-basic-dialogue-003",
        "label": "C",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l30-basic-dialogue-003-line-001",
            "speaker": "甲",
            "text": "もうすぐゴールデンウィークですね。何か予定がありますか。",
            "translationZh": "马上就是黄金周了。有什么计划吗？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "甲：もうすぐゴールデンウィークですね。何か予定がありますか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l30-basic-dialogue-003-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_basic",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson30/l30-basic-dialogue-003-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 4.5,
              "duration": 4.5,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:08:52.445Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "5f363eb31b33860f3dffc438d76a2beda75950f838bb5fca59fa6ce89d901f6d"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l30-basic-dialogue-003-line-002",
            "speaker": "乙",
            "text": "長江下りをしようと思っています。",
            "translationZh": "我打算乘船游览长江。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "乙：長江下りをしようと思っています。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l30-basic-dialogue-003-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_basic",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson30/l30-basic-dialogue-003-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 2.26,
              "duration": 2.26,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:08:52.445Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "5f363eb31b33860f3dffc438d76a2beda75950f838bb5fca59fa6ce89d901f6d"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l30-basic-dialogue-004",
        "label": "D",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l30-basic-dialogue-004-line-001",
            "speaker": "甲",
            "text": "土曜日も仕事ですか。",
            "translationZh": "星期六也上班吗？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "甲：土曜日も仕事ですか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l30-basic-dialogue-004-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_basic",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson30/l30-basic-dialogue-004-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 1.58,
              "duration": 1.58,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:08:52.445Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "5f363eb31b33860f3dffc438d76a2beda75950f838bb5fca59fa6ce89d901f6d"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l30-basic-dialogue-004-line-002",
            "speaker": "乙",
            "text": "ええ。香港からお客さんが来るので、空港へ迎えに行きます。",
            "translationZh": "是的。因为有客户从香港来，我要去机场迎接。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "乙：ええ。香港からお客さんが来るので、空港へ迎えに行きます。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l30-basic-dialogue-004-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_basic",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson30/l30-basic-dialogue-004-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 4.58,
              "duration": 4.58,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:08:52.445Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "5f363eb31b33860f3dffc438d76a2beda75950f838bb5fca59fa6ce89d901f6d"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "applicationText": {
    "title": "春のピクニック",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "l30-app-block-001",
        "type": "narration",
        "text": "4月的一个周末，小李想和北京分公司的职员一起去郊游。小李也跟森谈起这件事。",
        "translationZh": "四月的一个周末，小李想和北京分公司的职员一起去郊游，也跟森谈起这件事。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "4月的一个周末，小李想和北京分公司的职员一起去郊游。小李也跟森谈起这件事。"
      },
      {
        "id": "l30-app-block-002",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "在办公室",
        "translationZh": "在办公室。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（在办公室）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l30-app-block-003",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l30-app-block-003-line-001",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "今度の週末、みんなでピクニックに行こうと思っているんですが…。",
            "translationZh": "这个周末，我想大家一起去郊游……。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：今度の週末、みんなでピクニックに行こうと思っているんですが…。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l30-app-block-003-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson30/l30-app-block-003-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 4.18,
              "duration": 4.18,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:09:38.123Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "d1c470976a922df347118f744efd6b88322448001c75334bcd239e6b73c379ef"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l30-app-block-003-line-002",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "いいですね。どこへ行くんですか。",
            "translationZh": "好啊。去哪里呢？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "森：いいですね。どこへ行くんですか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l30-app-block-003-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson30/l30-app-block-003-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 2.42,
              "duration": 2.42,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:09:38.123Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "d1c470976a922df347118f744efd6b88322448001c75334bcd239e6b73c379ef"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l30-app-block-003-line-003",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "香山へ行こうと思います。",
            "translationZh": "我想去香山。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：香山へ行こうと思います。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l30-app-block-003-line-003",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson30/l30-app-block-003-line-003.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 2.02,
              "duration": 2.02,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:09:38.123Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "d1c470976a922df347118f744efd6b88322448001c75334bcd239e6b73c379ef"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l30-app-block-004",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "当天早晨，在分公司的楼前集合。森迟到了，跑着过来。",
        "translationZh": "当天早晨，大家在分公司楼前集合；森迟到了，跑着过来。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（当天早晨，在分公司的楼前集合。森迟到了，跑着过来）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l30-app-block-005",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l30-app-block-005-line-001",
            "speaker": "加藤",
            "text": "森君、遅いよ。",
            "translationZh": "森，你迟到了。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "加藤：森君、遅いよ。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l30-app-block-005-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson30/l30-app-block-005-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 1.86,
              "duration": 1.86,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:09:38.123Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "d1c470976a922df347118f744efd6b88322448001c75334bcd239e6b73c379ef"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l30-app-block-005-line-002",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "すみません。出かけようとした時に、電話があったんです。",
            "translationZh": "对不起。正要出门时来了电话。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "森：すみません。出かけようとした時に、電話があったんです。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l30-app-block-005-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson30/l30-app-block-005-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.74,
              "duration": 3.74,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:09:38.123Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "d1c470976a922df347118f744efd6b88322448001c75334bcd239e6b73c379ef"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l30-app-block-005-line-003",
            "speaker": "加藤",
            "text": "そうか。それじゃ、まあ、仕方ないな。",
            "translationZh": "是吗？那就没办法了。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "加藤：そうか。それじゃ、まあ、仕方ないな。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l30-app-block-005-line-003",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson30/l30-app-block-005-line-003.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 2.54,
              "duration": 2.54,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:09:38.123Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "d1c470976a922df347118f744efd6b88322448001c75334bcd239e6b73c379ef"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l30-app-block-005-line-004",
            "speaker": "加藤",
            "text": "馬さん、みんなそろったから、そろそろ出発しようか。",
            "translationZh": "小马，大家都到齐了，差不多该出发了吧。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "（面向小马）馬さん、みんなそろったから、そろそろ出発しようか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l30-app-block-005-line-004",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson30/l30-app-block-005-line-004.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.1,
              "duration": 3.1,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:09:38.123Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "d1c470976a922df347118f744efd6b88322448001c75334bcd239e6b73c379ef"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l30-app-block-005-line-005",
            "speaker": "馬",
            "text": "ええ、そうしましょう。",
            "translationZh": "好，就这么办吧。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "馬：ええ、そうしましょう。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l30-app-block-005-line-005",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson30/l30-app-block-005-line-005.mp3",
              "start": 0,
